{"overview":"پس از اینکه گروه قهرمانان پادشاه اهریمنی را شکست دادند، صلح را به سرزمین بازگرداندند و به زندگی‌های تنهایی بازگشتند. نسل‌ها می‌گذرند و جادوگر الف، فریرن، با مرگ بشریت روبرو می‌شود. او شاگرد جدیدی را به عنوان شاگرد خود انتخاب می‌کند و قول می‌دهد که آرزوهای دوستان قدیمی در حال مرگ را برآورده کند. آیا یک ذهن الفی می‌تواند با ماهیت زندگی و مرگ کنار بیاید؟ فریرن سفر خود را برای فهمیدن این موضوع آغاز می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After the party of heroes defeated the Demon King, they restored peace to the land and returned to lives of solitude. Generations pass, and the elven mage Frieren comes face to face with humanity's mortality. She takes on a new apprentice and promises to fulfill old friends' dying wishes. Can an elven mind make peace with the nature of life and death? Frieren embarks on her quest to find out.","tagline_en":"Living means being known and remembered by someone.","runtime":25,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":26,"y":2023,"poster":"/lzwTP54oEFkdPuN7SpvMXW4vKl.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":38,"y":2023,"poster":"/xgcpzPczYVSckEWVaz11b71rC0z.jpg"}],"episodes":38,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"آتسومی تانه‌زاکی","role":"Frieren (voice)","photo":"/6tM8GU7QvrdUCvR4kxqVUZivtvO.jpg","en":"Atsumi Tanezaki"},{"name":"市ノ瀬加那","role":"Fern (voice)","photo":"/hBJx5tpLA2vkXqfkPZosGjW4e8C.jpg","en":"Kana Ichinose"},{"name":"小林千晃","role":"Stark (voice)","photo":"/o0XZFXc50z28ICUpvfZ1QcTL2Yt.jpg","en":"Chiaki Kobayashi"},{"name":"岡本信彦","role":"Himmel (voice)","photo":"/7s1K2yQVF5iIWILaOfG7QrMZkXA.jpg","en":"Nobuhiko Okamoto"},{"name":"東地宏樹","role":"Heiter (voice)","photo":"/bU2vogWmnTWiQEwUADWlnBqAPhJ.jpg","en":"Hiroki Touchi"},{"name":"上田燿司","role":"Eisen (voice)","photo":"/fHvIfE0Q7ab0DFlkNVFcXvTKX9y.jpg","en":"Yoji Ueda"}],"trailer":"01WEqntM1NI","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/209867/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPW